# pnpm 11 reads ONLY auth/registry settings from .npmrc. The supply-chain posture
# (lifecycle-script policy, save-exact, engine-strict) now lives in pnpm-workspace.yaml,
# where pnpm 11 honors it at runtime. See pnpm-workspace.yaml.
#
# Do NOT add pnpm policy settings here — v11 ignores them, creating a silent false sense of
# security (this is what closed PR #379). Only auth/registry entries belong in this file.
